1
00:00:00,183 --> 00:00:02,700
He killed his entire family in one night.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:03,680
Then he spent years making

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:06,125
his little brother hate him, on purpose.

4
00:00:06,125 --> 00:00:07,860
Itachi Uchiha was a ninja,

5
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:09,700
in a world where hidden villages train children

6
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:10,888
to fight and spy.

7
00:00:10,888 --> 00:00:12,240
His clan, the Uchiha,

8
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,820
ran the village police and were born

9
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:15,424
with a rare power in their eyes.

10
00:00:15,424 --> 00:00:17,360
But after a monster attacked the village,

11
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:19,050
the leaders suspected the Uchiha.

12
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:21,636
Pushed aside, the clan began planning a coup.

13
00:00:21,636 --> 00:00:22,740
Itachi had one person

14
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:24,200
he loved more than anything:

15
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,635
his little brother, Sasuke.

16
00:00:25,635 --> 00:00:27,480
Whenever Sasuke begged him to train,

17
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:29,450
Itachi would poke his forehead and promise.

18
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:30,445
Next time.

19
00:00:30,445 --> 00:00:31,420
The village made Itachi

20
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:33,230
a spy inside his own clan.

21
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,600
Then the elders ordered him

22
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:35,740
to stop the coup by wiping

23
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:36,713
out the Uchiha.

24
00:00:36,948 --> 00:00:38,900
A civil war would have killed thousands.

25
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:39,970
So at thirteen,

26
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:42,378
Itachi chose the village over his family.

27
00:00:42,378 --> 00:00:43,260
He killed them all.

28
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:44,165
Except one.

29
00:00:44,598 --> 00:00:45,670
He couldn't kill Sasuke.

30
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:46,460
So he made sure

31
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:47,952
Sasuke would hate him instead.

32
00:00:47,952 --> 00:00:49,110
Hate would make him strong.

33
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,780
One day Sasuke would kill the traitor

34
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:52,036
and be called a hero.

35
00:00:52,036 --> 00:00:53,400
That explains the massacre.

36
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:54,476
It doesn't make it right.

37
00:00:54,795 --> 00:00:56,160
Years later, Sasuke caught him.

38
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:57,300
Sick and dying,

39
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:59,138
Itachi reached out one last time

40
00:00:59,419 --> 00:01:00,622
and poked his forehead.

41
00:01:01,155 --> 00:01:02,512
There would be no next time.

42
00:01:02,946 --> 00:01:04,100
Only after Itachi died

43
00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:05,730
did Sasuke learn the truth.

44
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:06,880
Every lie had been meant

45
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:08,245
to keep him alive.
